    {
      "id": "section:0/block:1/seg:0",
      "source": "Boot a new kernel from within a running kernel, without hardware reset",
      "source_hash": 16715792559530310160,
      "context_hash": 598484561492680448,
      "translation": "하드웨어 리셋 없이 실행 중인 커널에서 새 커널 부팅",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "hardware": "하드웨어",
        "kernel": "커널"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T22:37:57.328852Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:1/block:0/seg:0",
      "source": "What kexec does",
      "source_hash": 13236064765820344249,
      "context_hash": 821323063393577318,
      "translation": "kexec의 동작",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "kexec": "kexec"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T22:37:57.328852Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:1/block:1/seg:0",
      "source": "`kexec` loads a new kernel into memory and jumps to it directly, bypassing BIOS/UEFI POST and the bootloader:",
      "source_hash": 13798874067804030861,
      "context_hash": 9054366460264301262,
      "translation": "`kexec`는 새 커널을 메모리에 적재하고 BIOS/UEFI POST와 부트로더를 거치지 않고 곧바로 그 커널로 점프합니다:",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "kernel": "커널",
        "memory": "메모리"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T22:37:57.328853Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:1/block:3/seg:0",
      "source": "Primary uses:",
      "source_hash": 5883478613629353282,
      "context_hash": 18101900724253909715,
      "translation": "주요 용도:",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T22:37:57.328853Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:1/block:4/seg:0",
      "source": "**Fast reboot**: upgrade kernel in seconds instead of minutes",
      "source_hash": 5878661498105571802,
      "context_hash": 15913415946361364839,
      "translation": "**빠른 재부팅**: 커널 업그레이드를 몇 분이 아닌 몇 초 만에 완료",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "kernel": "커널"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T22:37:57.328853Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:1/block:5/seg:0",
      "source": "**kdump**: crash kernel boots capture kernel to save vmcore",
      "source_hash": 467095569194294735,
      "context_hash": 7908496912871788626,
      "translation": "**kdump**: 크래시가 난 커널이 vmcore를 저장하기 위해 캡처 커널을 부팅",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "kdump": "kdump",
        "kernel": "커널"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T22:37:57.328853Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:1/block:6/seg:0",
      "source": "**A/B kernel updates**: atomically switch to a new kernel",
      "source_hash": 13073029636820963231,
      "context_hash": 5138111429827570938,
      "translation": "**A/B 커널 업데이트**: 새 커널로 원자적으로 전환",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "kernel": "커널"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T22:37:57.328853Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:2/block:0/seg:0",
      "source": "kexec_load syscall",
      "source_hash": 14737584622721431541,
      "context_hash": 9162568504990170950,
      "translation": "kexec_load 시스템 콜",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "syscall": "시스템 콜"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T22:37:57.328853Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:2/block:2/seg:0",
      "source": "kexec_file_load: signature-verified loading",
      "source_hash": 5286452348048092270,
      "context_hash": 17261776582770595877,
      "translation": "kexec_file_load: 서명 검증을 거치는 적재",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T22:37:57.328853Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:2/block:3/seg:0",
      "source": "`kexec_file_load` takes a file descriptor instead of raw memory segments, enabling kernel image signature verification:",
      "source_hash": 5535346519279161430,
      "context_hash": 2237112689310641623,
      "translation": "`kexec_file_load`는 원시 메모리 세그먼트 대신 파일 디스크립터를 받으므로 커널 이미지 서명 검증이 가능합니다:",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "file descriptor": "파일 디스크립터",
        "kernel": "커널",
        "memory": "메모리"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T22:37:57.328853Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:2/block:5/seg:0",
      "source": "If `CONFIG_KEXEC_SIG=y`, the kernel image must be signed with a trusted key — useful for Secure Boot compatibility.",
      "source_hash": 10118040104270474513,
      "context_hash": 1347077317713485460,
      "translation": "`CONFIG_KEXEC_SIG=y`이면 커널 이미지는 신뢰할 수 있는 키로 서명되어 있어야 하며, 이는 Secure Boot 호환성에 유용합니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "kernel": "커널"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T22:37:57.328854Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:3/block:0/seg:0",
      "source": "Machine kexec: the jump",
      "source_hash": 15566470905202723731,
      "context_hash": 14270494783682421014,
      "translation": "Machine kexec: 점프",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "kexec": "kexec"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T22:37:57.328854Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:3/block:1/seg:0",
      "source": "When `kexec -e` is run, `machine_kexec()` performs the actual handoff:",
      "source_hash": 7673923147076074049,
      "context_hash": 13346271070021319753,
      "translation": "`kexec -e`를 실행하면 `machine_kexec()`가 실제 제어권 이양을 수행합니다:",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T22:37:57.328854Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:4/block:0/seg:0",
      "source": "kimage: the loaded kernel",
      "source_hash": 14418816489511520175,
      "context_hash": 17325181901909043448,
      "translation": "kimage: 적재된 커널",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "kernel": "커널"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T22:37:57.328854Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:5/block:0/seg:0",
      "source": "kdump integration",
      "source_hash": 1531494769162226723,
      "context_hash": 4134464939941218940,
      "translation": "kdump 연동",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "kdump": "kdump"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T22:37:57.328854Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:5/block:1/seg:0",
      "source": "kdump uses kexec to boot a capture kernel when the primary kernel crashes:",
      "source_hash": 537411013888935073,
      "context_hash": 9304481391764041598,
      "translation": "kdump는 주 커널에 크래시가 발생하면 kexec를 사용해 캡처 커널을 부팅합니다:",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "kdump": "kdump",
        "kernel": "커널",
        "kexec": "kexec"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T22:37:57.328854Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:5/block:3/seg:0",
      "source": "The capture kernel is loaded into a reserved physical memory region (`crashkernel=256M`) during normal boot.",
      "source_hash": 13995090748866875058,
      "context_hash": 7285203645867031518,
      "translation": "캡처 커널은 정상 부팅 중에 예약된 물리 메모리 영역(`crashkernel=256M`)에 적재됩니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "kernel": "커널",
        "physical memory": "물리 메모리"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T22:37:57.328854Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:5/block:3/seg:1",
      "source": "The primary kernel never uses this region, so it's intact after a crash.",
      "source_hash": 9051095865460840158,
      "context_hash": 5642212056335080470,
      "translation": "주 커널은 이 영역을 전혀 사용하지 않으므로 크래시 이후에도 이 영역은 온전하게 남아 있습니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "kernel": "커널"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T22:37:57.328854Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
